hadiths[166]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2133","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''is qadr apna nasab jano jis sey tum apney rishtey jod sako, isliye ke rishta jodney sey rishte-daaron ki mohabbat badhti hai, maal aur dolat mein izafa hota hai, aur aadmi ki umr badha di jati hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey gharib hai. 2- « منسأة في الأثر » ka matlab hai « الزيادة في"
"2134","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''koi dua itni jald qubul nahin hoti hai jitni jald ghaaieb aadmi key haq mein ghaaieb aadmi ki dua qubul hoti hai.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain. 2- Raavi Afriqi hadees key silsiley mein zaeef qarar diye gaey hain, unka naam Abdur-Rehman bin Ziyad bin Anam hai."
"2135","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''gaalii galoch karney waley do aadmiyon mein sey gaali ka gunah un mein sey shuru karney waley par hoga, jab tak mazloom had sey aagey na badh jaey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Saad , ibne-Masood aur Abdullah bin Mughaffal (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadisein marvi (riwayat hui) hain."
"2136","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''mardon ko gaali dey kar zindon ko takleef na pohchaao.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : is hadees ki riwayat karney mein Sufiyan key shagrid mukhtalif hain, baaz ney Hafri ki hadees key jasi riwayat ki hai (yani : \ عن زياد بن علاقة ، an المغيرة\"" key tareeq sey) aur baaz ney isey :(عن سفيان an زياد بن علاقة قال سمعت رجلا يحدث عند المغيرة بن شعبة an النبي صلى الله عليه"""""
"2137","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''musalman ko gaali dena fisq (nafarmaani) hai aur us sey jhagda karna kufr hai.''  Raavi Zubeda bin Haris kehtey hain : mainey abu-Waeil Shaqeeq bin Salma sey puchha : kya aap ney ye hadees Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey suni hai? kaha : haan. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2138","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jannat mein aisey bala-khaney hain jinke berooni (baahiri) hissey andar sey aur andruni hissey bahar sey nazar aayege.''  (ye sun kar) eik Erabi (dehati) (dehaati) ney khadey ho kar arz kya : Allah key Rasool ! kis key liye hain? aap ney farmaya : ''jo achchhi tarah baat karey , khana khilaaey , khub roza rakhey aur Allah ki raza key liye raat mein namaz padhey jabke log soey hon.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai. 2- hum isey sirf Abdur-Rehman bin Is-haq ki riwayat sey jantey hain, Is-haq bin Abdur-Rehman key haafze key talluq sey baaz muhaddeseen ney kalam kiya hai, ye koofa key rehney waley hain. 3- Abdur-Rehman bin Is-haq naam key eik doosrey Raavi hain, wo qarshi aur Madina key rehney waley hain, ye un sey asbat hain, aur dono key dono ek hi zamaane ke hain."
"2139","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''un key liye kya hi achchha hai ke apney rab ki itaat karen aur apney Malik ka haq ada karen.''  aap key is farman ka matlab laundi aur ghulam sey tha. Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain : Allah aur uskey Rasool ney sach farmaya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein abu-Musa Ash-ari aur ibne-Umar (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2140","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''teen aadmi mushk key tiley par hongey, qiyamat key din , pehla wo ghulam jo Allah ka aur apney malikon ka haq ada karey , doosra wo aadmi jo kisi qom ki imaamat karey aur wo us sey razi hon, aur teesra wo aadmi jo raat aur din mein namaz key liye paanch baar bulata hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, hum isey Sufiyan Sory ki riwayat sey jantey hain, jisey wo Abul Yaqzaan sey riwayat kartey hain. 2- Abul Yaqzaan ka naam Usman bin Qais hai, unhen Usman bin Umer bhi kaha jata hai aur yehi mashhoor hai."
"2141","ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jahan bhi raho Allah sey daro, burai key baad (jo tum sey ho jaey) bhalai karo jo burai ko mita dey padhi. aur logon key sath Hasan (achchhe) akhlaq sey pesh aaoo.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"2142","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''bad-gumaani sey bacho, isliye ke bad-gumaani sab sey jhooti baat hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- Sufiyan kehtey hain ke guman do tarah ka hota hai, eik tarah ka guman gunah ka sabab hai aur eik tarah ka guman gunah ka sabab nahin hai, jo guman gunah ka sabab hai wo ye hai ke aadmi kisi key barey mein guman karey aur usey zaban par laaye, aur jo guman gunah ka sabab nahin hai wo ye hai ke aadmi kisi key barey mein guman karey aur usey zaban par na laaye."
"2143","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam hamarey ghar walon key sath is qadr mil-jul-kar rehtey they ke hamarey chhotey bhai sey farmatey : Abu Umer ! nughair (ek tarah ki chidyaa) ka kya huwa?"
"2144","logon ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! aap hum sey hansi mazaq kartey hain? aap ney farmaya : ''main (khush tabae aur mazaak mein bhi) haq key siwa kuchh nahin kehta.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2145","eik aadmi ney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey sawari ki darkhaast ki, aap ney farmaya : ''main tumhen sawari key liye oontni ka bachcha dunga.''  us aadmi ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! main oontni ka bachcha kya karunga? Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''bhala oont ko oontni key siwa koi aur bhi janti hai?''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai."
"2146","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney in ko mukhatib kartey huye farmaya : ''aey do kaan waley !'' Mehmood bin Ghelaan kehtey hain : abu-Usaama ney kaha , yani aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney us sey mazaak kiya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees sahih gharib hai."
"2147","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo shakhs (jhagdey key waqt) jhoot bolnaa chhod dey halanke wo nahaq par hai, uskey liye atraafe-jannat main eik makaan banaya jaeyga, jo shakhs haq par hotey huye jhagda chhod dey uskey liye jannat key beech main eik makaan banaya jaeyga aur jo shakhs apney akhlaq achchhey banaey uskey liye aa'laa jannat main eik makaan banaya jaeyga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan hai, hum isey sirf Salma bin Vardaan ki riwayat sey jantey hain jisey wo Anas bin Malik sey riwayat kartey hain."
"2148","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''tumharey liye yehi gunah kafi hai ke tum hamesha jhagadtey raho.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees gharib hai, hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain."
"2149","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''apney bhai sey mat jhagdo, na us sey hansi mazaq karo, aur na us sey koi aisa wada karo jiski tum khilaf warzi karo.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain."
"2150","eik aadmi ney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas aaney ki ijazat maangi, us waqt main aap key paas thi, aap ney farmaya : ''ye qom ka bura beta hai, ya qom ka bhai bura hai.''  phir aap ney us ko andar aaney ki ijazat dey di aur us sey naram guftoogu ki, jab wo nikal gaya to mainey aap sey arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! aap ney to us ko bura kaha tha, phir aap ney us sey naram guftoogu ki, aap ney farmaya : ''Aaisha ! logon mein sab sey bura wo hai jiski bad zabani sey bachney key liye log usey chhod den.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2151","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''apney dost sey aetidaal aur aehtiyaat key sath dosti rakho shayad wo kisi din tumhara dushman ho jaey aur apney dushman sey aetidaal aur aehtiyaat key sath dushmani karo shayad wo kisi din tumhara dost bin jaaey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain. 2- ye hadees Ayub key wastey sey dusri sanad sey bhi aai hai, Hasan bin abi Jaafar ney apni sanad sey iski riwayat ki hai, jo Ali key wastey sey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam tak pahunchti hai, ye riwayat bhi zaeef hai, is riwayat key silsiley mein sahih baat ye hai ke ye Ali sey mauqufan marvi (riwayat hui) hai aur ye unka apna qol hai."
"2152","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jannat mein wo shakhs dakhil nahin hoga jis key dil mein raai key dane key barabar bhi takabbur (ghamand) hoga padhi. aur jahannam mein wo shakhs dakhil nahin hoga jis key dil mein raai key dane key barabar eman hoga.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Abu-Hurera , ibne-Abbas , Salma bin Akwaa aur abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2153","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jannat mein wo shakhs dakhil nahin hoga jis key dil mein raai key barabar bhi takabbur (ghamand) ho, aur jahannam mein dakhil nahin hoga yani wo shakhs jis key dil mein raai key dane key barabar bhi eman ho.'' eik aadmi ney aap sey arz kiya : main ye pasand karta hun ke merey kapdey aur jootey achchhey hon? aap ney farmaya : ''beshak Allah Taala jamaal (khoobsurti) ko pasand karta hai, lekin takabbur us shakhs key andar hai jo haq ko na maane  aur logon ko haqeer aur kam-tar samjhey.'' baaz ehle-ilm is hadees : (ولا يدخل النار يعني من كان في قلبه مثقال ذرة من إيمان) ki tafseer mein kehtey hain ke iska mafhoom ye hai ke jis key dil mein zarra barabar bhi eman ho wo jahannam mein hamesha nahin rahega, abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jis key dil mein zarra barabar bhi eman hoga wo jahannam sey bil-aakhir zarur nikleyga.''  kaee Tabe-een ney is aayat : (ربنا إنك من تدخل النار فقد"
"2154","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' insan hamesha apney aap ko takabbur ( ghamand ( ki taraf ley jata hai, yahan tak ke zalimon ki fehrist mein uska naam likh diya jata hai, aur isliye usey wohi azab laahiq hota hai jo zalimon ko laahiq huwa ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
"2155","log kehtey hain ke merey andar takabbur hai, halanke mainey gadhey ki sawari ki hai, moti chadar pahni hai aur bakri ka doodh doha hai aur Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jisney ye kaam kiye uskey andar bilkul takabbur nahin hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai."
"2156","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' qiyamat key din momin key meezaan mein akhlaq Hasna sey bhari koi chiz nahin hogi aur Allah Taala be-haya aur bad-zaban sey nafrat karta hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Aaisha , abu-Huraira, Anas aur Usama bin Shareek (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2157","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''agar koi chiz taqdir par sabqat ( pehal ( kar sakti to is par nazare-bad zarur sabqat ( pehal ( karti , aur jab log tum sey ghusl karaaein to tum ghusl kar lo.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai. 2- Hayaa bin Habis ki riwayat (jo ooper mazkur (zikr) hai) gharib hai. 3- Sheban ney isey (عن يحيى بن أبي كثير an حية بن حابس an أبيه an أبي هريرة an النبي صلى الله عليه"
"2158","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney hamen eik sariya mein bheja , hamney eik qom key paas padaao dala aur un sey ziyaafat (mehman-nawazi) ki darkhaast ki, lekin un logon ney hamari ziyaafat (mehman-nawazi) nahin ki, usi doran unkey sardar ko bichchhu ney dank maar diya, chunanche unhoney hamarey paas aa kar kaha : kya aap mein sey koi bichchhu key dank sey jhaad phunk karta hai? mainey kaha : haan , main karta hun, lekin us waqt tak nahin karunga jab tak ke tum mujhey kuchh bakriyan na dey do, unhoney kaha : hum tum ko tees bakriyan dengey, chunanche hamney qubul kar liya aur mainey saat baar Sura Fatiha padh kar is par dam kiya to wo sehat-yaab ho gaya aur hamney bakriyan ley lein, hamarey dil mein bakriyon key mutalliq kuchh khayal aaya padhi. , lihaza hamney kaha : jaldi na karo, yahan tak ke hum Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas pahunch jaeyn, jab hum aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas pahunchey to mainey jo kuchh kiya tha aap sey bayan kar diya, aap ney farmaya : ''tum ney kaisey jana ke Sura Fatiha taawez (jhaad phunk ki dua) hai? tum log bakriyan ley lo aur apney sath is mein mera bhi hissey lagaao.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai. 2- Shoba , Abu Awaana Hisham aur kaee logon ney ye hadees (عن أبي المتوكل an أبي سعيد an النبي صلى الله عليه"
"2159","kuchh Sahaba (jinmein shamil main bhi tha) Arab key eik qabila key paas sey guzrey, unhoney un ki mehman nawaazi nahin ki, isi doran unka sardar bimar ho gaya, chunanche in logon ney hamarey paas aa kar kaha : aap logon key paas koi ilaj hai? hamney kaha : haan , lekin tum ney hamari mehman nawaazi nahin ki hai isliye hum us waqt tak ilaj nahin kerengey jab tak tum hamarey liye ujrat na mutayyan kar do, unhoney uski ujrat mein bakri ka eik galla muqarrar kiya, hum mein sey eik aadmi (yani mein khud) uskey ooper Sura Fatiha padh kar dam karney laga to wo sehatyaab ho gaya, phir jab hum Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas aaye aur aap sey us waqiea ko bayan kiya to aap ney farmaya : ''tumhen kaisey malum huwa ke Sura Fatiha jhaad phunk (ki dua) hai? abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ney aap sey is par koi nakeer zikr nahin ki, aap ney farmaya : ''khaao aur apney sath is mein mera bhi hissa lagaao.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees sahih hai. 2- ye hadees Aamash ki is riwayat sey jo Jaafar bin Ayas key wastey sey aai hai ziyada sahih hai. 3- kaee logon ney ye hadees :(عن أبي بشر جعفر بن أبي وحشية an أبي المتوكل an أبي"
"2160","Mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey puchha : Allah key Rasool ! jis dam sey hum jhaad phunk kartey hain, jis dawaa sey ilaj kartey hain aur jin bachaaw ki chizon sey hum apna bachaaw kartey hain (un key barey mein aap ka kya khayal hai?) kya ye Allah ki taqdir mein kuchh tabdili karti hain? aap ney farmaya : ''ye sab bhi Allah ki likhi hui taqdir hi ka hissa hain.''"
"2161","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' ajwa ( khajoor ( jannat ka phal hai, is mein zahar sey shifaa mojud hai aur sehraye Arab ka «Faqaa» padhi. eik tarah ka « man » (Salwa wala « man » ( hai, uska arq aankh key liye shifaa hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, 2- ye Muhammad bin Amr ki riwayat sey hai, hum isey sirf Muhammad bin umr hi Saeed bin Aamir ki riwayat sey jantey hain jisey wo Muhammad bin Amr sey riwayat kartey hain, padhi. 2- is bab mein Saeed bin Zaid , abu-Saeed aur Jabir (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2162","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Sehraye-Arab ka Faqaa eik tarah ka « man » (Salwa wala « man » ( hai aur uska arq aankh key liye shifa hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2163","Hazrat Abu-Hurera kehtey hain ki sahaba mein sey kuch logon ney kaha : khunbi zamin ki chechak hai, ( ye sun kar) Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' sehraye Arab ka «Faqaa» eik tarah ka « man » hai, uska arq aankh key liye shifaa hai, aur ajwa khajoor jannat key phalon mein sey eik phal hai, wo zahar key liye shifaa hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan hai."
"2164","mainey teen, paanch ya saat khumbi li, unko nichoda, phir uska arq eik shishi mein rakha aur usey eik ladki ki aankh mein dala to wo sehat yaab ho gaee."
"2165","kalonji maut key ilawa har bimari ki dawa hai. Qatada har roz kalonji key ikkis daney letey, unko eik potli mein rakh kar pani mein bhigotey phir har roz dahiney nathney mein do boond aur baaein main eik boond daltey, doosrey din baaein mein do boondein aur daahini main eik boond daltey aur teesrey roz dahiney mein do boond aur baaein main eik boond daltey ."
"2166","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney kuttey ki qeemat , zaaniya aurat ki kamai aur kaahin key nazraney leney sey mana farmaya padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2167","mein Abdullah bin Akeem abu-Maabad johni key yahan un ki iyaadat karney gaya, in ko « حمرة » ka marz tha padhi. hamney kaha : koi Taawiz waghera kyon nahin latka letey hain? unhoney kaha : maut us sey ziyada qarib hai, Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jisney koi chiz latkaai wo usi key supurd kar diya gaya''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : Abdullah bin Akeem ki hadees ko hum sirf Muhammad bin Abdur-Rehman bin abi Leila ki riwayat sey jantey hain, Abdullah bin Akeem ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey hadees nahin suni hai lekin wo aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key zamaney mein they, wo kehtey they : Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney hum logon key paas likh kar bheja hai."
"2168","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''bukhaar jahannam ki garmi sey hota hai, lihaza usey pani sey thanda karo ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : is baab mein Asma bint abu-Bakar, ibne-Umar, Zuber ki biwi, ummul-momenin Aaisha aur ibne-Abbas (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain (Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) ki riwayat aagey aa rahi hai)."
"2169","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''bukhaar jahannam ki garmi sey hota hai, lihaza usey pani sey thanda karo ''."
"2170","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam Sahaba ko bukhar aur har qism key dard mein ye dua padhna sikhatey they, بسم الله الكبير أعوذ بالله العظيم من شر كل عرق نعار ومن شر حر النار''main badey Allah key naam sey shuru karta hun aur azmat waley Allah key wastey sey har bhadakti rag aur aag ki garmi key shar sey panah maangta hun ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, 2- hum isey sirf Ibrahim bin Ismail bin abu-Hubeba ki riwayat sey jantey hain aur Ibrahim bin Ismail zaeeful-Hadis samjhey jatey hain, 3- baaz ahadees mein « arq Nuaar» key bajaey « arq Yuaar» bhi marvi hai."
"2171","mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey suna : ''main ney irada kya ke dudh pilaney key dinon mein sohbat karney sey logon ko mana kar dun, phir mainey dekha ke Faras aur Rome key log aisa kartey hain, aur un ki aulad ko koi nuqsan nahin pahunchta''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- Malik ney ye hadees عن أبي الأسود an عروة an عائشة an جدامة بنت وهب an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم ki sanad sey isi jaisi hadees riwayat ki hai, padhi. 3- is bab mein Asma bint Yazeed sey bhi riwayat hai, 4- Malik kehtey hain : «"
"2172","unhoney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey huye suna : ''main ney irada kya tha ke dudh pilaney key dinon mein jima karney sey logon ko mana karun, phir mujhey yad aaya ke Rome aur Faras key log aisa kartey hain aur us sey un ki aulad ko koi nuqsan nahin pahunchta hai ''. Malik kehtey hain : « غيلہ » ye hai ke koi shakhs dudh pilaney key dinon main apni biwi sey jima kerey. Esa bin Ahmed kehtey hain : hum sey Is-haq bin Esa ney bayan kya wo kehtey hain : mujh sey Malik ney Abul-Aswad key wastey sey usi jaisi hadees bayan ki. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib sahih hai."
"2173","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam Zatul-Janb  ki bimari mein zaitun ka tel aur waras padhi. tashkhis kartey they, Qatada kehtey hain is ko munh mein dala jaeyga, aur munh ki us janib sey dala jaeyga jis janib marz ho. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- abu-Adbullah ka naam Memun hai, wo eik Basra Shekh hain."
"2174","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney hamen hukm diya ke Zatul-Janb ka ilaj qust bahri (Ud hindi) aur Zaitun key tel sey karen . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib sahih hai, 2- hum isey sirf Memun ki riwayat sey jantey hain jisey wo Zaid bin Arqam sey riwayat kartey hain, 3- Memun sey kaee logon ney ye hadees riwayat ki hai."
"2175","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam iyaadat key liye merey paas tashrif laye, us waqt mujhey aisa dard tha ke lagta tha wo maar daleyga, Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''apney dahiney haath sey saat martaba dard ki jagah chhuo aur ye dua padho أعوذ بعزة الله وقوته وسلطانه من شر ما أجد ''main Allah ki izzat aur uski qudrat aur taqat key waseeley sey us takleef key shar sey panah maangta hun jo mujhey laahiq hai ''. mainey wesa hi kya aur Allah Taala ney meri takleef door kar di, chunanche main hamesha apney ghar walon ko aur dusron ko ye dua padhney ka mashwara deta hun . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2176","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney un sey puchha ke ''daston (loose motions) key liye tum kya leti ho? ''main ney kaha : Shabram, aap ney farmaya : '' wo garm aur bahaney wala hai ''. Asma kehti hain : phir mainey « Sana» padhi. ka Mus-hil liya to Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' agar kisi chiz mein maut sey shifaa hoti to « suna » mein hoti ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, 2- is sey) yani «Sana» sey) murad dast aawar dawa hai."
"2177","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas eik aadmi ney aa kar arz kya : merey bhai ko dast aa raha hai, aap ney farmaya : '' usey shehad pilao'' , chunanche usney isey pilaya , phir aaya aur arz kya : Allah key Rasool ! mainey usey shehad pilaya lekin us sey dast mein aur izafa ho gaya hai, Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''usey shehad pilao'', usney usey shehad pilaya, phir aap key paas aaya aur arz kya : Allah key Rasool! mainey usey shehad pilaya lekin us sey dast mein aur izafa ho gaya hai, abu Saeed Khudri kehtey hain : Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah taala (apney qol mein) sacha hai, aur tumharey bhai ka pet jhoota hai, usko shehad pilao'' , chunanche usney shehad pilaya to (is baar) achcha ho gaya . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2178","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jo musalman banda kisi aisey mareez ki iyaadat karey jiski maut ka abhi waqt na huwa ho aur saat baar ye dua padhey أسأل الله العظيم رب العرش العظيم أن يشفيك ''main azmat waley Allah aur azeem arsh key Malik sey dua karta hun ke wo tumhen achcha kar dey '' to zarur uski shifaa ho jati hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, 2- hum isey sirf minhaal bin Amr ki riwayat sey jantey hain."
"2179","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jab tum mein sey kisi ko bukhar aaye aur bukhar aag ka eik tukda hai to wo usey pani sey bujha dey , eik behti nehar mein utrey aur pani key bahaw ki taraf apna rukh karey phir ye dua padhey : « بسم الله اللهم اشف عبدك وصدق رسولك » ''Allah key naam sey shuru karta hun, aey Allah ! apney bandey ko shifaa dey aur apney Rasool ki is baat ko sacha bana '' wo us amal ko Fajr key baad aur suraj nikalney sey pehley karey , wo us nehar mein teen din tak teen ghotey lagaey, agar teen din mein achcha na ho to paanch din tak, agar paanch din mein achcha na ho to saat din tak aur agar saat din mein achcha na ho to no din tak , Allah key hukm sey uska marz no din sey aagey nahin badheyga. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees gharib hai."
"2180","Sehal bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) sey puchha gaya aur main sun raha tha ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key zakham ka kis chiz sey ilaj kya gaya? unhoney kaha is chiz ko mujh sey ziyada janney wala ab koi baqi nahin hai, Ali (Raziallahu anhu) apni dhaal mein pani la rahey they, jabke Fatima (Raziallahu Anha) aap key zakham sey khoon dho rahi thin aur main aap key liye taat jala raha tha, phir usi ki raakh sey aap ka zakham bhara gaya . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2181","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jab mareez sehatyaab aur tandurust ho jaey to shaffafiyat aur rang mein uski misal us oley ki tarah hai jo aasman sey girta hai''."
"2182","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jab tum mareez key paas jaao to maut key silsiley mein uska gham door karo padhi. ye taqdir to nahin badlta hai lekin mareez ka dil khush kar deta hai''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees gharib hai."
"2183","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas eik aadmi ney aa kar arz kya : mera pota mar gaya hai, mujhey uski meeras mein sey kitna hissey milega ? aap ney farmaya : '' tumhen chata hissey milega , jab wo mud kar janey laga to aap ney usey bula kar kaha : '' tumhen eik aur chata hissey milega'', phir jab wo mud kar janey laga to aap ney usey bulaya kar farmaya : ''doosra chata hissey bator khurak hai''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Maaqil bin Yasar (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"2184","abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) key paas eik daadi ya naani ney aa kar kaha : mera pota ya nawasa mar gaya hai aur mujhey bataya gaya hai ke Allah ki kitab ( Quran ( mein merey liye mutayyan hissa hai. abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : main Allah ki kitab ( Quran ( main tumharey liye koi hissa nahin paata hun aur na mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey suna hai ke aap ney tumharey liye kisi hissey ka faisla kya, albatta main logon sey is barey mein poochhunga. abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney uskey barey mein logon sey puchha to Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) ney gawahi di ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney usey chata hissa diya, abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : tumharey sath usko kisney suna hai? Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : Muhammad bin Muslima ney. chunanche abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney usey chata hissa dey diya, phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) key paas uskey ilawa dusri daadi aai ( agar pehley wali daadi thi to umr key paas naani aai aur agar pehli wali naani thi to umr key paas daadi aai) Sufiyan bin Uena kehtey hain : Zohri key wastey sey riwayat kartey huye Maamar ney is hadees mein mujh sey kuch ziyada baaten bayan ki hain, lekin Zohri key wastey sey marvi riwayat mujhey yad nahin, albatta mujhey Maamar ki riwayat yad hai ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : agar tum dono (daadi aur naani) waris ho to chatey hissey mein dono shareek hongi, aur jo munfarid ho to chata hissa usey milega."
"2185","abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) key paas eik daadi ya naani meeras sey apna hissa poochhney aai, abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney us sey kaha : tumharey liye Allah ki kitab ( Quran ( mein kuch nahin hai aur tumharey liye Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki sunnat mein bhi kuch nahin hai, tum lot jaao yahan tak ke main logon sey is barey mein poochh lun, unhoney logon sey is barey mein puchha to Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : main Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas mojud tha, aap ney daadi ya naani ko chata hissa diya, abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : tumharey sath koi aur bhi tha? Muhammad bin Muslima Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huye aur isi tarah ki baat kahi jaisi Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) ney kahi thi . chunanche abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney uskey liye hukm jari kar diya, phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) key paas dusri daadi ( agar pehli daadi thi to dusri naani thi aur agar pehli naani thi to dusri daadi thi) meeras sey apna hissa poochhney aai. unhoney kaha : tumharey liye Allah ki kitab ( Quran ( mein kuch nahin hai albatta wohi chata hissa hai, agar tum dono ( daadi aur naani) ijtimae taur par waris ho to chata hissa tum dono key darmiyan taqseem kya jaeyga, aur tum mein sey jo munfarid aur akeli ho to wo usi ko milega . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- aur ye ( Malik ki) riwayat Sufiyan bin Uena ki riwayat ki banisbat ziyada sahih hai, 3- is bab mein Barida (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"2186","wo ( potey key tarkey mein) daadi aur uskey betey key hissey key barey mein kehtey hain : wo pehli daadi thi jisey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney uskey betey ki mojudgi mein chata hissey diya, us waqt uska beta zinda tha . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- hum isey sirf isi sanad sey marfoo jantey hain, 2- baaz Sahaba ney betey ki mojudgi mein daadi ko waris thehraya hai aur baaz ney waris nahin thehraya hai."
"2187","umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ney abu-Ubaida (Raziallahu anhu) ko likha ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya hai : '' Allah aur uskey Rasool wali) sar parast ( hain jiska koi wali) sar parast ( nahin hai aur mamu us aadmi ka waris hai jis ka koi waris nahin hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein ummul-momenin Aaisha aur Miqdam bin Maadikarb Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2188","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' mamu us aadmi ka waris hai jis ka koi waris nahin hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, 2- baaz logon ney isey mursalan riwayat kya hai aur is mein Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) key wastey ka zikr nahin kya, 3- is masley mein Sahaba kiram ka ikhtilaf hai, baaz logon ney mamu , khaala aur phuphi ko waris thehraya hai. zul-arham ( qurbat daaron ( ko waris bananey key barey mein aksar ehle-ilm isi hadees ki taraf gaey hain, 4- lekin Zaid bin Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) ney bhi unhen waris nahin thehraya hai ye meeras ko baitulmal mein rakhney key qaail hain."
"2189","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ka eik azad karda ghulam khajoor ki tehni sey gira aur mar gaya, Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' dekho , kya uska koi waris hai? '' Sahaba ney arz kya : nahin, aap ney farmaya : '' uska maal uskey gaaon key kuch logon ko dey do''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan hai."
"2190","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key zamaney main eik aadmi mar gaya aur apney peechey koi waris nahin chhoda siwaye eik ghulam key jisko usney azad kya tha, Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney usi ghulam ko uski meeras dey di . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein ehle-ilm ka amal hai ke jab koi aadmi mar jaey aur apney peechey koi usba na chhodey to uska maal musalmanon key baitul-mal mein jama kya jaeyga."
"2191","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' musalman kafir ka waris nahin hoga aur na kafir musalman ka waris hoga '' padhi. ."
"2192","Barira apney zare-kitabat key barey mein un sey taawun maangney ayen aur zare-kitabat mein sey kuch nahin ada kya tha. ummul-momenin Aaisha ney un sey kaha : tum apney ghar walon key paas jaao agar wo pasand karen ke main tumhari zare-kitabat ada kar dun aur tumhari wala ( meeras (ka haq mujhey hasil ho, to main ada kar dungi . Barira ney apney ghar walon sey uska zikr kya, to unhoney inkar kar diya aur kaha : agar wo chahti hon ke tumhen azad kar key sawab hasil karen aur tumhara haq wala ( meeras ( hamarey liye ho to wo tumhen azad kar den , ummul-momenin Aaisha ney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey uska zikr kya to aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney un sey farmaya : '' usey kharido aur azad kar do isliye ke haq wala ( meeras ( usi ko hasil hai jo azad karey '' phir Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam khadey huye aur farmaya : '' logon ko kya ho gaya hai, wo aisi shartein lagatey hain jo Allah ki kitab mein mojud nahin ? jo shakhs koi aisi shart lagaey jo Allah ki kitab ( Quran ( mein mojud nahin to wo uska mustahiq nahin hoga, agar-che wo so baar shart lagaey ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) sey ye hadees kaee sanadon sey aai hai. padhi. 3- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai ke azad karney waley hi ko haq wala ( meeras ( hasil hai."
"2193","Ibn 'Umar (R.A.) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (S.A.W.) ne farmaya: \Woh shakhs jis ne tohfa diya...\"""""""
"2194","Hazrat Ibn-e-Umar aur Hazrat Ibn-e-Abbas (Razi Allah unhoin se) ne Marfu Hadees rawai farmaya ke: \Kisi mard ke liye yeh halaal nahi hai ke woh kisi ko tohfa de aur phir use wapas le le.\"""""""
"2195","Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah ne apni taraf se apne walid se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jab Ash-Sham ke rehne wale fasaad karne lagein...\"""""""
"2196","Ibn 'Abbas (razi Allahu anhuma) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Mere baad kufr ki taraf na laut jao.\"""""""
"2197","Busr bin Saʿeed ne farmaya: Fitnah ke dauran — yaʿni ʿUthmān bin ʿAffān رضی اللہ عنہ ke zamānah mein —"
"2198","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Neik aamaal ki taraf jaldi karo. Ek aisi fitna peda hogi jo andhere ki raat ke tukde jaisi hogi.\"""""""
"2199","Umm Salamah (رضي الله عنها) ne riwayat ki: \n\Ek raat Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne jag kar farmaya:\"""""""
"2200","Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Qayamat se pehle aisi fitan aayengi jaise andheri raat ke tukde. Aadmi subah momin ki halat mein hoga"
"2201","Abdullah ibn Mu'awiyah al-Jumahi al-Basri ne hum se rivayat kiya, Salih al-Murri ne hum se rivayat kiya, Hisham ibn Hassan se, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, Abu Hurayrah ne kaha: ""Rasoolullah ﷺ ham par taashir hue jab hum qadar (taqdeer) mein behas kar rahe the. Unka chehra surkh ho gaya, jaise gaal par anar phor diya gaya ho. Unhone farmaya: 'Kya isi ke liye tumhe hukm diya gaya? Ya isi ke liye tumhe bheja gaya? Jo log tum se pehle the wo tabah hue jab unhonne is baat mein behas ki. Main tum par wajib karta hoon ke is mein behas na karo.'"" Abu Isa ne farmaya: Is baab mein Umar, Aisha, Anas se bhi riwayat hain. Ye hadith gharib hai, hum isay sirf isi tareeq se Salih al-Murri ke zariye jante hain. Salih al-Murri ke gharib ahadith hain jo woh akela rivayat karta hai, koi uska mutaba' (taiqeed karne wala) nahi."
"2202","Thawban (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jab mere Ummat par talwar chalai jaye...\"""""""
"2203","Udaasah bint Uhban bin Safi Al-Ghifari (رضي الله عنها) ne farmaya: \Ali (رضي الله الله عنه) mere baap ke paas aaye taake unhe saath nikalne (jihad ke liye) bulayein. Mere baap ne un se kaha: 'Yaqeenan mera mahboob...'\"""""""
"2204","Al-Ḥasan ibn ʿAlī al-Ḥulwānī ne riwāyat karte hue farmāyā: ʿAbdullāh ibn Numayr aur Wakīʿ ne hamārī taraf se riwāyat kī, unhoṅ ne al-Aʿmash se, unhoṅ ne Saʿd ibn ʿUbaydah se, unhoṅ ne Abū ʿAbd al-Raḥmān al-Sulamī se, aur unhoṅ ne ʿAlī (raḍiyallāhu ʿanh) se riwāyat kī, unhoṅ ne farmāyā:\n\n\Jab ham Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wasallam) ke sāth the"
"2205","Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: \Main aapko ek hadith sunata hoon jo maine Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni thi.\"""""""
"2206","Az-Zubair bin 'Adi ne farmaya: \Hum Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) ke paas aaye. Hum ne un se Al-Hajjaj ki taraf se jo museebat humein pahunch rahi thi"
"2207","Anas (r.a.) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (s.a.w.) ne farmaya: \Qayamat qayam na hogi jab tak 'Allah"
"2208","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Zameen apne andar ke tukde (andaron ke hisson) bahar phenkegi: sona aur chandi aise khade tukde niklenge jaise sutoon (stambh).\"" Unhon ne farmaya: \""Ek chor aayega aur kahega: 'Isi ke liye mere haath kaat diye gaye?' Ek qaatil aayega aur kahega: 'Isi ke liye maine qatl kiya?' Aur rishto kaatne wala aayega aur kahega: 'Isi ke liye maine rishte kaat diye?' Phir woh sab usey chhodh kar chale jayenge"
"2209","Hazrat Hudhaifah bin Al-Yaman (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Qayamat qayam nahi hogi jab tak duniya mein sab se khushnasib shakhs Luka' bin Luka' na ho jaye.\"""""""
"2210","Ali bin Abi Talib (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jab meri Ummah cheeshat kaar karegi...\"""""""
"2211","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jab al-fa'i (ghaneemat ke maal) mein taraf-dari se taqseem kiya jaye...\"""""""
"2212","Imran bin Husain (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Is Ummat mein zameen ka dhasne (collapsing of the earth) hoga.\"""""""
"2213","Al-Mustwarid bin Shaddaad Al-Fihri (رَضِيَ اللَّهُ عَنْهُ) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَسَلَّ) ne farmaya:\n\n\Main Saʿa ke aage aage bheja gaya hoon.\"""""""
"2214","Anas (r.a.) rivayet etti ki Rasool Allah (s.a.w.) ne farmaya: \Qayamat aur main aise bheje gaye hain jaise ye dono\"" — aur Abu Dawud (rawi) ne apne angusht aur madhyamā ungli se ishara kiya —"""""
"2215","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Qayamat qayam nahi hogi jab tak tum aise logon se nahi lare jinki jooton mein baal (hair) ka istemal ho.\"""""""
"2216","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jab Kisra ka nizam barbaad ho jayega...\"""""""
"2217","Wāṣil ibn ʿAbd al-Aʿlā al-Kūfī ne hamain sunaya, farmaaya: Muḥammad ibn Fuḍayl ne hamain sunaya, al-Qāsim ibn Ḥabīb aur ʿAlī ibn Nizār se, Nizār se, ʿIkrimah se, Ibn ʿAbbās (Raz.) se, unhone farmaaya:\n\nRasūlullāh, ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam ne farmaaya:\n\n*\Merī Ummat mein se do giroh Islām mein se koi hissā nahin rakhte: Murji'ah aur Qadariyyah.\""""*\n\nAbū ʿĪsā (Tirmidhī) ne farmaaya: \""""Is bāb mein ʿUmar"
"2218","Abu Hurairah (R.A.) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (S.A.W.) ne farmaya: \Qayamat qayam nahi hogi jab tak qareeb qareeb sachche dhokebaaz (imposters) nikal nahi aate.\"""""""
"2219","Thawban (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Qayamat qayam nahi hogi jab tak meri Ummat ke qabeelay but-paraston ke saath mil kar unke saath honge.\"""""""
"2220","Ibn 'Umar (raziyallahu 'anhuma) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Thaqif mein ek bada jhoota aur tabahkar paida hoga.\"""""""
"2221","Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Logon mein sab se behtar meri qaum (yaani meri nasl) hai.\"""""""
"2222","Imran bin Husain (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \n\myry amt myn sb say bhtr wh nsl hay js myn myn bhyja gya hwn۔\"""""""
"2223","Simak bin Harb ne Jabir bin Samurah (razi Allahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: \Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: 'Mere baad barah Amir honge.' \"" Unhone kaha: \""Phir unhon ne koi baat farmayi jo mujh se samajh nahi aayi. Maine apne paas baithne wale se poochha...\"""""""
"2224","Ziyaad bin Kusaib Al-Adawi ne farmaya: \Main Abu Bakrah (radiyallahu anhu) ke saath Ibn Aamir (radiyallahu anhu) ke mimbar ke neeche tha"
"2225","Salim bin 'Abdullah ne apne baap se riwayat ki, unhone farmaya: \Umar bin Al-Khattab (رضي الله عنه) se kaha gaya: 'Shayad aap apna khalifa muqarrar kar dein.' Unhon ne farmaya: 'Agar main khalifa muqarrar karoon"""""
"2226","Riwāyat:\n\nAḥmad ibn ʿAbdah al-Ḍabbī ne ham se riwāyat kī: Ḥammād ibn Zayd ne ham se riwāyat kī, Yaḥyā ibn Saʿīd se, Abū Umāmah ibn Sahl ibn Ḥunayf se, ki ʿUthmān ibn ʿAffān (رضي الله عنه) ne Yawm al-Dār (Ghar ke Din) ko dīvār par se jhāṅk kar farmāyā:\n\n> \Main tumhe Allāh kī qasam detā hūn — kyā tum jānte ho ki Rasūlullāh (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ne farmāyā thā:\n>\n> *'Ek Musalmān kā khūn jāʾiz nahīn hai illā tīn suraton mein se ek surat mein: shādī ke bād zinā (*zinā baʿda iḥṣān*)"
"2227","Abdullah bin Abi Al-Hudhail ne farmaya: \Amr bin Al-As ke saath Rabi'ah (qabeelay) ke kuch log the."""""
"2228","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Raat aur din tabah nahi honge jab tak ek aadmi jiska naam Jahjah hai"
"2229","Thawban (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Main apni Ummat ke liye sirf gumraah karne wale a'aimmah se darta hoon.\"" Phir unhon ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Meri Ummat ki ek ghaib nahi rukegi jo haq par zaahir hokar rahegi.\"""""""
"2230","Abdullah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Yeh duniya tab tak khatam nahi hogi jab tak mere Ahle Bayt (ahl-e-bayt) mein se ek aadmi Arabon par hukumat kare jiska naam mere naam ke mutabiq ho.\"""""""
"2231","Hadīth kā Tarjumah\n\nRiwayat 'Abdullāh ibn Mu'āwiyah al-Jumaḥī al-Baṣrī (raziyallāhu 'anhu) ne, jin se Ḥammād ibn Salamah (raḥimahullāh) ne riwayat kī, un se Abū al-Zubayr (raḥimahullāh) ne, aur un se Jābir (raziyallāhu 'anhu) ne riwayat kih:\n\n> Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne is se man' farmāyā kah talwār ko nikāl kar (khol kar) na diyā jāe.\n\nAbū 'Īsā (imām Tirmidhī, raḥimahullāh) ne farmāyā: *\Is bāb mein Abū Bakrah (raziyallāhu 'anhu) kī bhī riwayat hai.\""*\n\nPhir unhon ne farmāyā: *\""Yeh Ḥammād ibn Salamah kī sanad se ek ḥasan gharīb hadīth hai.\""*\n\nAur unhon ne izāfarmāyā: *\""Ibn Lahī'ah ne bhī yeh hadīth Abū al-Zubayr se"
"2232","Zaid bin Al-'Ammi ne farmaya: \Maine Abu As-Siddiq An-Naji se suna"
"2233","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Uss Zaat ki qasam jiske qaboo mein meri jaan hai! Ibn Mariam (alaihis salaam) tumhare darmiyan jald hi utarenge.\"""""""
"2234","Abu Ubaidah bin Al-Jarrah (raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: \Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Nuh (alaihis salam) ke baad koi Nabi aisa nahi aya magar usne apni qaam ko Dajjal se daraya.'\"""""""
"2235","Az-Zuhri ne Salim se riwayat ki, aur Salim ne Ibn Umar (radiyallahu anhuma) se naqal kiya ke unhone farmaya:\n\n\Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) logon ke darmiyan khade ho kar...\"""""""
"2236","Ibn 'Umar (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \n\Tum Yahood se jang karoge"
"2237","Abu Bakr As-Siddiq (رَضِيَ ٱللَّٰهُ عَنْهُ) ne farmāyā: \Rasool Allah (صَلَّى ٱللَّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَسَلَّم) ne hamārē ḥāẓir bayān farmāyā۔\"""""""
"2238","Qutaybah ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki, ʿAbd al-ʿAzīz ibn Muḥammad ne riwayat ki, ʿAmr ibn Abī ʿAmr se, ʿAbd Allāh — yaʿnī Ibn ʿAbd al-Raḥmān al-Anṣārī al-Ashhalī — se, Ḥudhayfah ibn al-Yamān (raḍiya Allāhu ʿanhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne farmāyā:\n\n\Usī Khudā kī qasam jis ke qabdamere rūḥ hai"
"2239","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Razi Allah unhu) ne farmaya: \Qayamat ke qareeb aane par Qustuntunia (Constantinople) fatah ho jayega.\"""""""
"2240","Bundār ne riwāyat kī, ʿAbd al-Raḥmān ibn Mahdī se, unhone Sufyān se, unhone Qays ibn Muslim se, unhone Ṭāriq ibn Shihāb se, unhone farmāyā:\n\n\Pehle shakhs jisne namāz se pahle khuṭbah diyā"
"2241","Ibn 'Umar (raziyallahu 'anhuma) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi ﯷ se Dajjal ke baare mein sawaal gaya."
"2242","Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Dajjal Madinah Munawwara aayega to paayega ke farishton ne use gher liya hai. Na taoon us mein dakhil hoga aur na Dajjal.\"""""""
"2243","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Iman Yemeni hai.\"""""""
"2244","Mujammi' bin Jariyah Al-Ansari (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne farmaya: \n\Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmaate suna: \n'Eesa bin Maryam (alaihimas salam) Dajjal ko Ludd ke darwaze par qatl karenge.'\"""""""
"2245","Anas (razi Allahu anhu) ne bayan farmaya ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Koi Nabi aisa nahi tha magar usne apni Ummat ko us jhoote aandhe se daraya. Suno! Woh ek aankh se andha hai.\"""""""""""""
"2246","Abu Sa'eed (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya: \Main Ibn Sa'eed (رضي الله عنه) ke saath tha — ya to Hajj kar rahe thay ya Umrah — log chalay gaye...\"""""""
"2247","Abu Sa'eed (raziyallahu anho) ne bayan farmaya ke: \Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ibn Sa'eed se Madinah ki ek gali mein mulaqat ki.\"""""""
"2248","Hazrat Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Bakrah (raziya Allahu anhu) ne apne baap Hazrat Abu Bakrah (raziya Allahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Dajjal ka baap aur uski maa...\"""""""
"2249","Sufyān ibn Wakīʿ ne apne wālid se riwāyat kī, unhone al-Qāsim ibn al-Faḍl se, unhone Abū Naḍrah al-ʿAbdī se, aur unhone Abū Saʿīd al-Khudrī رَضِيَ اللَّهُ عَنْهُ se riwāyat kī ke Rasūlullāh ﷺ ne farmāyā:\n\n\Usī Zaat kī qasam jis ke qabūl mein merī jān hai"
"2250","Mahmūd ibn Ghaylān ne hamain bataya: Abū Dāwūd ne hamain riwāyat kī, Shuʿbah se, al-Aʿmash se, Mujāhid se, Ibn ʿUmar (رضي الله عنهما) se, unhone farmāyā:\n\n\Rasūlullāh (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ke zamānah mein chand phaṭ gayā thā"
"2251","Das Nishān-e-Sāʿah Kī Ḥadīsh\n\nMatn\n\nḤudhayfah ibn Asīd (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhu) se marwī hai:\n\nUnhon ne farmāyā: \Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ek hujre se hamārē sāmne tashrīf lāe jab ham Sāʿah kī bāat kar rahe thē. Nabī-e-Karīm (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne farmāyā:\n\n'Sāʿah qā'im nahīṅ hogī jab tak tum das nishāniyāṅ na dekh lo: Sūragh maghrib kī jagah se uṭhnā"
"2252","Ubayy bin Ka'b (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Hawa ko mat laanat karo. Jab tum use kuch aisa dekho jo tumhe na pasand ho"
"2253","Fatimah bint Qais (raziyallahu anha) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) minbar par chadhay."
"2254","Hannād ne hamari taraf se riwāyat kī: Abū Mu'āwiyah ne riwāyat kī, unho ne al-A'mash se, unho ne Ibrāhīm al-Taymī se, unho ne apne wālid se, unho ne Abū Dharr (raz̤allāhu 'anhu) se riwāyat kih unhone farmāyā:\n\n\Masjid mein dākhil huā jab sūraj ḍhūb chukā thā aur Nabī (ṣallallāhu 'alayhi wa sallam) baiṭhe hue thā. Unhone farmāyā: 'Ai Abū Dharr"
"2255","Zainab bint Jahsh (Allah un se razi ho) ne bayan farmaya:\n\nRasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) neend se uthay to unke chehra surkh tha aur woh teen martaba \Lā ilāha illallāh\"""" (Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahi) padh rahe thay. Phir farmaya: \""""Afsos Arab par ek burai ke jo qareeb aa chuki hai! Aaj Ya'jūj aur Ma'jūj (Ya'jūj aur Ma'jūj) ki deewar mein aisi chhed kar di gayi hai\"""" — aur unhon ne apni ungli aur anguthi ko milakar ek halqa banaya"
"2256","Abū Kurayb, Muḥammad ibn al-ʿAlāʾ, ne ham se riwāyat kī: Abū Bakr ibn ʿAyyāsh ne ham se riwāyat kī, ʿĀṣim se, Zirr se, aur ʿAbdullāh ibn Masʿūd (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhu) se, unhone farmāyā: Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne farmāyā:\n\n\Ākhir-e-zamān mein aise log paidā honge jo umr mein chhoṭe aur samajh mein nādān honge. Woh Qurʾān paṛhēge lekin woh unke galoṅ se āge nahīṅ guzregā. Woh behtarīn khalq ke kalām kahēge"
"2257","Abdur-Rahman bin Abdullah bin Mas'ood (radiyAllahu anhum) ne apne walid Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ood (radiyAllahu anhu) se riwayat ki."
"2258","Abu Wa'il ne Hudhaifah se riwayat ki ke Umar (radiyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: \Tum mein se kaun Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki us baat yaad rakhta hain jo Woh Fitnah ke baare mein farmayi thi?\"" Hudhaifah (radiyallahu anhu) ne kaha: \""Main yaad rakhta hoon.\"" Hudhaifah (radiyallahu anhu) ne kaha: \""Aadmi ki Fitnah uske ahal-o-ayal mein hai.\"""""""
"2259","Ka'b bin Ujrah (razi Allahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: \Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamare paas nikle.\"""""""
"2260","Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Logon par aisa zaroor aayega jab deen par sabr karne wale ke haalat aise hongi jaise jalti hui koeli ko pakadne wale ki.\"""""""
"2261","Abu Hafs, Amr ibn Ali ne riwayat ki, unho ne Yahya ibn Said se riwayat ki, unho ne Fudayl ibn Ghazwan se riwayat ki, unho ne Ikrimah se riwayat ki, aur unho ne Ibn Abbas (radi Allahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Mere baad ek doosre ki gardan maar kar kufr ki taraf na lot jao.\"" Abu Isa (al-Tirmidhi) ne kaha: Is bab mein Abdullah ibn Mas'ud"
"2262","Abu Bakrah (raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: \Allah Ta'ala ne mujh par aisa sabab nikaal diya jo maine Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna tha. Jab Kisra ka khatma ho gaya...\"""""""
"2263","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kuch logon ke paas aaye jo baithay hue the."
"2264","Umar bin Al-Khattab (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Kya tumhein apke behtareen aur badtareen leaders ke baare mein nahi bataun? Tumhare behtareen leaders woh hain jinhein tum pasand karte ho aur woh tumhein pasand karte hain.\"""""""
"2265","Umm Salamah (raziyallahu anha) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Yaqeenan tumhare saamne aise aayein ge aise imam jo tumhe pasand honge (unki baaz a'mal) aur baaz (unki baaz a'mal) tumhe na-pasand honge. Pas jo inka inkar karega"""""
"2266","Abu Hurairah (R.A.) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (S.A.W.) ne farmaya: \Jab tumhare sardaar tum mein se behtreen hon...\"""""""
"2267","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Tum aisi zindagi mein ho jis mein jo shakhs hukm diye gaye kaam ka daswa hissa chhod de to halal hai.\"""""""
"2268","Ibn 'Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) minbar par khade hokar farmaya: \Fitnon ki zameen wahan hai"
"2269","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Khurasan se siyah alaatein aayengi.\"""""""
"2270","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jab qayamat qareeb ho jaye...\"""""""
"2271","Ubadah bin As-Samit (R.A.) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (S.A.W.) ne farmaya: \n\Momin ka khwaab"
"2272","Anas bin Malik (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak Risalat aur Nabwwat khatam ho chuki hain.\"""""""
"2273","Ata' bin Yasar ne Misr ke ek ahad se riwayat ki, jisne kaha: Maine Abu Ad-Darda (رضي الله عنहें) se Allah Ta'ala ke farmaan ke baare mein poocha..."
"2274","Abu Sa'eed (rzَ allُ anُ) say rwayt hay kh pyghambrِ akrm (sl allُ alِ wslmَّ) nay frmaya: \n\rat kay aakhry ghntwn myn khwab sb say zyadh schay hwtay hyn۔\"""""""
"2275","Anas (Razi Allah anho) ki rivayat hain ki Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Qayamat qayam na hogi jab tak zameen par 'Allah"
"2276","Abdullah (r.a.) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (s.a.w.) ne farmaya: \n\Jis ne mujh ko (khwaab mein) sote hue dekha"
"2277","Abu Qatadah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \n\Khwaab Allah ta'ala ki taraf se hain aur hulum (buray khwaab) Shaitaan ki taraf se hain. Pas jab tum mein se koi aisa kuch dekhe jo use bura lage...\"""""""
"2278","Waki' bin 'Udus rivayat karte hain ke Abu Razin Al-'Uqaili ne farmaya: Rasool Allah (s.a.w) ne farmaya: \Momin ka khwaab nabuwat ke chalees hisson ka ek hissa hai. Aur woh parindey ke tangey par (tika hua) hai.\"""""""
"2279","Waki' bin 'Udus (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne Abu Razin (raziyallahu 'anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Muslim ki neend mein aya hua khwaab nabuwat ke chhiyalis (46) hisson ka ek hissa hai. Aur woh ek parinday ke tangey par qaaim hai (ya'ni bilkul nazar mein rehta hai"
"2280","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Teen qism ke khwaab hote hain: ek sachcha khwaab"
"2281","Muhammad ibn Umar ibn Hayyaj al-Asadi al-Kufi ne hum se rivayat kiya, Yahya ibn Abdur Rahman al-Arhabi ne hum se rivayat kiya, Ubaydah ibn al-Aswad ne Mujalid se, Qays ibn Abi Hazim se, al-Mustawrid ibn Shaddad al-Fihri ne Nabi ﷺ se marfu' rivayat kiya ke unhonne farmaya: ""Mujhe sa'at (qayamat) ke dam (waqt) mein bheja gaya hai, main usay aise paish kadam kiya jaise ye do ungliyan (shahadat aur wusta) ek dusre se paish hain."" Abu Isa ne farmaya: Ye hadith al-Mustawrid ibn Shaddad se gharib hai, hum isay sirf isi tareeq se jante hain."
"2282","(doosri silsilah) Abu 'Abdur-Rahman As-Sulami ke zariye jo unhon ne Sayyiduna Ali (radiyallahu 'anhu) se, aur Sayyiduna Ali (radiyallahu 'anhu) ne Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi tarah ki rivayat naql ki hai. [Imam ne farmaya: Yeh rivayat Hasan hai.] Is mazmoon par Ibn Abbas (radiyallahu 'anhu) se bhi rivayatain maujood hain."
"2283","Ibn 'Abbas (radiyAllahu 'anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallAllahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jis shakhs ne jhoota sapna dikhaya...\"""""""
"2284","Ibn 'Umar (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jab main so raha tha...\"""""""
"2285","Abu Umamah bin Sahl bin Hunaif (rz all anh) nay nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm kay chnd shabh kram rzwan allh alyhm ajmayn say rwayt ky hay kh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya:\n\n\myn sw rha tha kh mjhay lwg pysh kyay gyay۔\"""""""
"2286","Abu Umamah bin Sahl bin Hunaif ne Abu Sa'eed al-Khudri (razi Allahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: isi ma'ani mein (jis tarah)"
"2287","Abu Bakrah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: \Ek din Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se kisne dekha hai?' Ek shakhs ne kaha: 'Maine. Maine dekha jaise aasmaan se ek tarazu utra"
"2288","Aishah (radiyallahu anha) ne farmaya: \Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Waraqah ke baare mein poochha gaya. Khadijah (radiyallahu anha) ne unhen bataya: 'Usne aap par iman laya.'\"""""""
"2289","Salim bin Abdullah ne Abdullah bin Umar (radiya Allahu anhum) se naqal kiya ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), Abu Bakr Siddiq (radiya Allahu anho) aur Umar Farooq (radiya Allahu anho) ke khwaab ke mutalliq hadith bayan farmaayi."
"2290","Salim bin Abdullah ne apne baare mein riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (s.a.w) ke khwaab ka zikra hai, jis mein farmaya:\n\n\Main ne ek kaali aurat ko dekha jis ke baal bikhre hue the aur woh Madina Munawwara se nikal rahi thi...\"""""""
"2291","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Aakhri zamane mein...\"""""""
"2292","Ibn 'Abbas (razi Allahu anhu) ne Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Main ne ek khwaab dekha ke goya mere do haathon mein do sone ki payalein thin"
"2293","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke ek shakhs Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur us ne kaha: \Maine ek khwaab dekha ke ek baadal tha jis se makhan aur shahad tapak raha tha. Main ne logon ko dekha ke woh apne haathon se use nikal rahe thein.\"""""""
"2294","Samurah bin Jundub (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: \Jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne humein Subh ki namaz padhaai...\"""""""
"2295","Zaid bin Khalid Al-Juhani (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne farmaya: \کیا تمہیں بہترین گواہ کے بارے میں نہیں بتاؤں؟ وہ شخص جو اپنی گواہی اس سے پوھنچا دے اس سے پہلے کہ اس سے گواہی مانگی جائے۔\"""""""
"2296","Muhammad ibn Bashshar al-Abdiyy ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki, Abu Bakr al-Hanafiyy ne riwayat ki, Abd al-Hamid ibn Ja'Far se, Umar ibn al-Hakam se, unhone kaha: Maine Abu Hurayrah (radhiAllahu anhu) ko farmate suna ke RasoolAllah (sallAllahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Raat aur din tab tak nahi guzrega jab tak ek mawla (aazad shuda banda) hukumat na karega jiska naam Jahjah hoga.\"" Abu Isa (al-Tirmidhi) ne kaha: Yeh hasan gharib hadith hai."""""
"2297","Zaid bin Khalid Al-Juhani (Razi Allah unho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Behtareen gawah woh hai jo apni gawahi us waqt de jab us se maangi jaaye se pehle hi.\"""""""
"2298","Aishah (radiyAllahu anha) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallAllahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Na khayin mard ki gawahi qabool hoti hai"
